  "schema": 2,
  "scope": "Nuria source release; runtime histories, secrets and private infrastructure are excluded",
  "baseline_commit": "e30346af50a0b8ca6db0c71974e385c737828fb3",
  "deployment_identity": "Live API reports component commits, deployment time and source hashes; the original circuit retains its historical startup identity",
  "changes": [
    "Independent 1024-neuron cognitive circuit with source-specific prequential learning, memory, workspace and measured autonomous outcomes",
    "Atomic cognitive checkpoints and hash records; original 256-neuron history preserved",
    "Read-only treasury observation, durable caps and unsigned single-transfer preparation; financial execution disabled",
    "Updated observatory, documentation, capability map and bounded evaluation evidence",
    "Streaming compatible encrypted recovery archives with bounded upload readback and both circuit snapshots",
    "Full-width neural field, detailed measured connection rendering, compact responsive instruments and expandable receipts",
    "Source-specific adaptive forecast council, fair stronger baselines and fresh-seed memory/attention ablations; failed and null neural results retained",
    "Depth-shaded neural field with recorded synaptic timing, membrane and weight layers, shared spike raster, held-window inspection and off-screen rendering suspension",
    "Minimal neural-layer toolbar, compact measurements, unnumbered navigation and readable checkpoint/evidence controls",
    "Independent persistent hidden-world decision lab, delayed outcome learning, costed sensing, virtual budgets, adaptive curriculum and fresh-world paired controls with retained failed neural-superiority gate",
    "Conscious-token research branding, shared header/footer vector identity and bounded small-screen navigation",
    "Onchain consciousness experiment framing across the observatory, metadata and documentation",
    "Unified responsive presentation, unclipped live instruments, shared neural monogram and repository brand graphics; neural histories unchanged",
    "Isolated exact Solana USDC x402 execution, durable purchase evidence, measured paid-outcome credit, guarded Pump claim planning and encrypted commerce ledger snapshots; activation disabled and missing funding/conversion rails explicit",
    "Managed parsed-transaction custody, guarded creator collection and reserve forwarding, destination-bound Squads funding, constrained SOL-to-USDC conversion, durable signing ceilings, finalized wallet observation and complete paginated public financial evidence; production execution remains disabled",
    "Custom accessible replay listbox, suppressed form completion, linked project contact and GitHub marks, shared experience/authority/evidence diagrams, repaired documentation scrolling/sidebar, six-group capability map with status filters, simplified search and single uppercase chapter breadcrumbs; all 51 entries, histories and guarded financial execution preserved",
    "Direct managed creator-beneficiary funding, guarded stdin custody input, immutable total-session testing ceilings, anchored finalized-history payment expiry reconciliation, explicit new Pump sweep activation gate and current-evidence UI recovery; production spending remains disabled",
    "Current native Pump retained-fee sweep and collection vectors, zero-rent simulation gates, conserved curve/pool/vault payout accounting, official SVM SDK intent comparison and persistent free-information purchase refusal; live token claims and paid delivery remain unverified",
    "Persistent isolated information-acquisition trials with free alternatives, delayed chosen-source credit and retained negative comparisons; conserved pre-sign native claim economics, bounded evidence requests, shared vector media, measured capacity and authenticated archive recovery. Production mint and spending remain unconfigured.",
    "Current Jupiter V2 instruction review, same-bank pre-sign conversion cost and token-authority checks, zero-retained-rent wrapping, signer-free fresh route rehearsal and adversarial economic/submission regression coverage. Native execution remains disabled."
  ],
